<body>
    <h1>User discovery</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>Parent Firms</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"9ca3e91a-b2f0-46e2-8a25-5419cbf615df">Wellington-Altus</l=
i>
 <li data-uuid=3D"dfb2fed0-d765-482e-a899-85ee63232483">Harbourfront</li>
</ul>
<p>Sub-Advisory</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"ac81539b-8f29-4caa-89ec-c2f178bd2118">RN Croft</li>
</ul>
<p>Combo:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"a0796353-aae0-4d26-8806-350a1b9f967e">Guardian</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"aab2be79-189d-4a9e-84f4-a95e4de828c1">Fiera Capital</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"4587d684-579e-49fc-92c5-643ac582c4dd">:question: Highview=
</li>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<p>The following questions are framed for an interview with Client (individ=
uals or a group) from a firm which falls under one of the parent firm patte=
rns, and the person(s) have responsibilities on client accounts across mult=
iple firm segments or business arms.&nbsp;</p>
<p>In addition, we also want to have an interview with a user administrator=
 in the firm, if there is one.</p>
<h2 id=3D"Userdiscovery-Contextofthissession">Context of this session</h2>
<p>In the context of parent firm access model, we would like to chat with i=
ndividuals from client firms set up in any one of the parent firm patterns.=
 There are two typical personas fit in our user discovery:&nbsp;</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"95c599c1-a225-4d77-bc47-44e784536684">A back office staff=
 who support or supervise the activities across different arms of business.=
</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"4a3d0bf4-d098-47e7-8d62-d5f78d6fe71c">A user administrato=
r (aka firm security steward) who manages user access, profile lifecycle an=
d performs user attestation.</li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"Userdiscovery-Profiling">Profiling</h2>
<ol>
 <li data-uuid=3D"c8c46709-b085-4beb-9435-faabe16f1b90">Can you briefly des=
cribe your role at your firm and your responsibilities?</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"c28e068f-955e-4688-bc2d-0f8bccde1c6b">What is the size of=
 your team? How about your firm as a whole?&nbsp;</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"722ce982-8f18-4850-9405-0bb72458d223">Do your team member=
s have the similar responsibilities as you?</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"18c5c91d-b347-4cfb-8602-6ea1d4e42dbf">How do you interact=
 with the different arms of business? For what purposes?=20
  <ol>
   <li data-uuid=3D"f6490392-a8da-49b1-97d8-0ab3250f6424">If you are a user=
 administrator for your firm in Compass, do you oversee all profiles across=
 sub-firms and arms?</li>
  </ol></li>
 <li>Are there different types of customers you serve?</li>
</ol>
<h2 id=3D"Userdiscovery-Persona/Userjourney">Persona / User journey</h2>
<ol>
 <li data-uuid=3D"0c49869b-0ef3-490b-b751-72d46f61ce18">What are the typica=
l activities you do day-to-day?=20
  <ol>
   <li data-uuid=3D"f97b1660-3cf5-4e48-9fde-7c6312c9f1fe">Start of the day<=
/li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"e5a93767-b28c-4ece-b445-189c2286e2bb">End of the day</l=
i>
  </ol></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"c3a98aed-a9c5-4195-9e6d-576c9641672d">What are your criti=
cal tasks throughout the day?=20
  <ol>
   <li data-uuid=3D"ac86e288-19a1-4065-801f-d9d6dcd54781">Which ones are hi=
ghly valuable, e.g. add value to customers, boost company revenue, mitigate=
 risks?</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"3a4f39e4-d082-4910-85ae-0c87e24a35a1">Which ones are ti=
me-consuming, operational ineffective?</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"205910ea-9660-4ea3-91b2-6dc0935977d8">How much time do =
you spend on those tasks?&nbsp;</li>
  </ol></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"85416d77-1bea-4cc2-a97f-1d2f93a69c43">Are there any time-=
sensitive tasks which must be done fast or by a certain time of the day?</l=
i>
 <li>Are there any other tasks you would do periodically, e.g. weekly, quar=
terly or annually?<br>
  <ol>
   <li data-uuid=3D"e95f0d32-e080-4bc6-98ce-fb828db5897c">How long does it =
take to finish the task?</li>
  </ol></li>
</ol>
<h2 id=3D"Userdiscovery-Problem&amp;Painpoints">Problem &amp; Pain points</=
h2>
<ol>
 <li data-uuid=3D"6c60b7e0-81b2-4398-8560-8ecd839f2faa">What does a good da=
y look like?</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"699d8aba-a830-47f6-a1cf-5c65b9e7eeef">What does a bad day=
 look like?&nbsp;</li>
 <li>What are some significant challenges in your job?=20
  <ol>
   <li data-uuid=3D"c638313a-115b-4881-92e4-dde6aeba762c">Why do they matte=
r?</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"e849a39f-5996-401e-9d02-b268d32965b7">How do you solve =
it or work around it?</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"637dfe25-5a5a-44f2-943c-1fcd976f0a24">What do you think=
 how it should work?</li>
  </ol></li>
</ol>
<h2 id=3D"Userdiscovery-Platforms&amp;Tools">Platforms &amp; Tools</h2>
<ol>
 <li data-uuid=3D"22ec6fab-acf4-4b3f-b8b8-173592a24363">Can you name the pl=
atforms and tools you use the most for work?=20
  <ol>
   <li data-uuid=3D"2c6d51a9-d89d-4660-8294-d2cf32a15dd7">How much time you=
 spend on each one of them?</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"24910740-56bd-4ecf-8825-262cf83bac06">What functions do=
 you use them for?&nbsp;</li>
  </ol></li>
 <li>Which of the platforms or tools are the most valuable to you? Why?</li=
>
 <li data-uuid=3D"e97cda1f-3dc7-4447-a083-8549f8232117">Usually, can you co=
mplete the functions you use them for?&nbsp;=20
  <ol>
   <li data-uuid=3D"612ab1a2-cc9e-4377-8296-dc32ce6f451a">Are there any cha=
llenges (usability, stability...)? Which ones bother you the most?</li>
  </ol></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"dc40e77a-ad92-4f7d-acaf-3a44de203a21">Can you share with =
us why you are not using Compass for certain available capabilities?</li>
</ol>
<p><br></p>
<p>Global access =E2=86=92 IB vs. PM features</p>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
